content.text:
I now have all the data needed. Here is the complete extraction:

---

## 1. Overall Page Structure — `testimonials.html`

The page has **only two main content sections** between the navbar and footer:

| # | Element | Class |
|---|---------|-------|
| 1 | Navbar wrapper | `<section class="header-sec">` → contains banner + navbar |
| 2 | **Testimonials grid** | `<section class="work-sec2">` |
| 3 | Footer + Beta popup | `<section class="footer">` |

There is **no hero section** on the testimonials page. It goes directly from the navbar into the testimonials grid section.

---

## 2. Hero Section

There is **no hero section** on the testimonials page. The page structure starts immediately with the `.work-sec2` testimonials grid section — no banner, no trust badges, no typewriter, no GuideJar embed.

---

## 3. Testimonials Grid Section — Full Structure

### HTML Structure (lines 336–380)

```html
<section class="work-sec2">
  <div class="container-large-8">
    <div class="work-sec2-title">
      <h2 class="heading-2 margin-top-0">See what the biggest<br>SaaS brands say.</h2>
    </div>
    <div fb-animation="testimonials" class="w-layout-grid grid-three-column-2">

      <!-- Card 1 -->
      <div class="testimonial-card work-test-card">
        <div class="column-x-large-2">
          <img src="images/Vector-11.svg" alt="Quote Icon" class="testimonial-card-logo">
          <p class="work-test-text">Hey Design just keeps getting better and better. Our LinkedIn ad creatives are consistently great, and are always delivered on time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="row-x-small-2">
          <div class="avatar-large">
            <img src="images/af2fda69703f68c959392af501a46eae8b59b9f2.png" class="image-cover-5">
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="paragraph-medium-2 text-weight-medium text-left"><strong>Sabrina</strong></div>
            <div class="paragraph-small-9 text-color-tertiary text-left">Head of Marketing at Modash</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2 — identical content/structure to Card 1 -->
      <!-- Card 3 — identical content/structure to Card 1 -->

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
```

There are **3 cards**, all identical in structure and content (placeholder data — same quote, same name "Sabrina", same avatar). The quote icon (`Vector-11.svg`) is absolutely positioned at the top of each card.

---

## 4. Exact CSS Values

### `.work-sec2` — Section wrapper

```css
/* Base */
.work-sec2 {
  background-color: #fff;
  padding: 220px 5% 64px;  /* top 220px, horizontal 5%, bottom 64px */
  position: relative;
}

/* Modifier for testimonials page */
.work-sec2.testimonial-secs {
  padding-top: 60px;
  padding-bottom: 74px;
}
```

**Note:** The testimonials page uses `<section class="work-sec2">` — NOT `.testimonial-secs`. The `.testimonial-secs` modifier exists but is applied on other pages (e.g. `/our-works`). On the testimonials page the section has no modifier class, so it gets the base padding: `220px 5% 64px`.

### `.container-large-8` — Content container

```css
.container-large-8 {
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 1280px;
  margin-left: auto;
  margin-right: auto;
}
```

### `.work-sec2-title` — Section heading wrapper

```css
.work-sec2-title {
  grid-column-gap: 12px;
  grid-row-gap: 12px;
  text-align: center;
  flex-flow: column;
  margin-bottom: 60px;
  display: flex;
}
```

### `.grid-three-column-2` — 3-col grid

```css
.grid-three-column-2 {
  grid-column-gap: 24px;
  grid-row-gap: 24px;
  grid-template-rows: auto;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  display: grid;
}
```

### `.testimonial-card` — Base card

```css
.testimonial-card {
  grid-column-gap: 32px;
  grid-row-gap: 32px;
  border: 1px solid #d4d4d8;
  border-radius: 16px;
  flex-flow: column;
  justify-content: space-between;
  padding: 32px;
  display: flex;
}
```

### `.testimonial-card.work-test-card` — Modifier (applied on testimonials page)

```css
.testimonial-card.work-test-card {
  grid-column-gap: 0px;
  grid-row-gap: 0px;
  background-color: #21cfff0d;   /* cyan at ~5% opacity */
  border-color: #21cfff;         /* cyan border */
  border-radius: 20px;
  justify-content: flex-start;
  padding-left: 25px;
  padding-right: 25px;
  position: relative;
}
```

### `.testimonial-card-logo` — Quote icon (absolutely positioned)

```css
.testimonial-card-logo {
  width: 52px;
  max-width: 150px;
  position: absolute;
  inset: -7% auto auto 25px;  /* top: -7%, left: 25px */
}
```

### `.column-x-large-2` — Card body wrapper

```css
.column-x-large-2 {
  grid-column-gap: 30px;
  grid-row-gap: 30px;
  flex-flow: column;
  display: flex;
}
```

### `.work-test-text` — Quote text

```css
.work-test-text {
  color: #2b2b2b;
  font-family: Roobert PRO, Arial, sans-serif;
  font-size: 18px;
  line-height: 27px;
}
```

### `.avatar-large` — Author avatar

```css
.avatar-large {
  background-color: #f5f7f8;
  border-radius: 100%;
  flex: none;
  width: 48px;
  height: 48px;
  overflow: hidden;
}
```

### `.paragraph-small-9` — Author role text

```css
.paragraph-small-9 {
  margin-bottom: 0;
  font-size: 14px;
  line-height: 1.5;
}

.paragraph-small-9.text-color-tertiary {
  color: #71717b;
}
```

---

## 5. Responsive Breakpoints

| Breakpoint | Class | Value |
|---|---|---|
| `min-width: 1280px` | `.work-sec2` | `padding-top: 180px` |
| `min-width: 1440px` | `.work-sec2` | `padding-top: 180px` |
| `max-width: 991px` | `.work-sec2.testimonial-secs` | `padding-top: 50px` |
| `max-width: 991px` | `.work-sec2-title` | `margin-bottom: 60px` |
| `max-width: 991px` | `.grid-three-column-2` | `grid-template-columns: 1fr` (single column) |
| `max-width: 767px` | `.work-sec2` | `padding-top: 40px` |
| `max-width: 767px` | `.work-sec2.testimonial-secs` | `padding-top: 20px; padding-bottom: 50px` |
| `max-width: 767px` | `.work-sec2-title` | `margin-bottom: 40px` |
| `max-width: 479px` | `.work-sec2.testimonial-secs` | `padding-top: 40px` |
| `max-width: 479px` | `.work-test-text` | `font-size: 16px; line-height: 24px` |
| `min-width: 1440px` | `.grid-three-column-2` | `grid-column-gap: 40px; grid-row-gap: 40px` |

---

## Key Implementation Notes

1. **No hero section** — the page jumps straight from navbar to the testimonials grid.
2. **Section class** is just `.work-sec2` (no `.testimonial-secs` modifier), so base padding is `220px 5% 64px` at desktop.
3. **Grid** is 3 columns (`1fr 1fr 1fr`) at desktop, collapses to **1 column** at `max-width: 991px`.
4. **Cards** have a cyan (`#21cfff`) border and very light cyan background (`#21cfff0d`) via the `.work-test-card` modifier.
5. The quote icon (`.testimonial-card-logo`) is absolutely positioned with `inset: -7% auto auto 25px` — it floats above the card's top edge.
6. The testimonials data (3 cards) appears to be **placeholder content** in the export — all three cards have identical text, name, and avatar image.
